{"Name":"Add Comment to Detection","Description":"Deprecated. Add a comment to the detection in Crowdstrike Falcon.","Script":"from SiemplifyAction import SiemplifyAction\nfrom SiemplifyUtils import output_handler\nfrom ScriptResult import EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED, EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\n\nfrom TIPCommon.extraction import extract_configuration_param, extract_action_param\n\nfrom constants import (\n    API_ROOT_DEFAULT,\n    INTEGRATION_NAME,\n    ADD_COMMENT_TO_DETECTION_SCRIPT_NAME,\n)\nfrom CrowdStrikeManager import CrowdStrikeManager\n\n\n@output_handler\ndef main():\n    siemplify = SiemplifyAction()\n    siemplify.script_name = ADD_COMMENT_TO_DETECTION_SCRIPT_NAME\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Param Init -----------------\")\n\n    api_root = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"API Root\",\n        default_value=API_ROOT_DEFAULT,\n    )\n    client_id = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify, provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME, param_name=\"Client API ID\"\n    )\n    client_secret = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify, provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME, param_name=\"Client API Secret\"\n    )\n    use_ssl = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Verify SSL\",\n        input_type=bool,\n        is_mandatory=True,\n    )\n    customer_id = extract_configuration_param(\n        siemplify,\n        provider_name=INTEGRATION_NAME,\n        param_name=\"Customer ID\",\n        print_value=True,\n    )\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Started -----------------\")\n\n    detection_id = extract_action_param(\n        siemplify, param_name=\"Detection ID\", is_mandatory=True\n    )\n    comment = extract_action_param(siemplify, param_name=\"Comment\", is_mandatory=True)\n\n    result_value = True\n    status = EXECUTION_STATE_COMPLETED\n\n    try:\n        manager = CrowdStrikeManager(\n            client_id=client_id,\n            client_secret=client_secret,\n            use_ssl=use_ssl,\n            api_root=api_root,\n            customer_id=customer_id,\n        )\n\n        detection_status = manager.get_detection_status(detection_id)\n        manager.add_comment_to_detection(comment, detection_id, detection_status)\n\n        output_message = (\n            f\"Successfully added comment to detection with identifier: {detection_id}.\"\n        )\n\n    except Exception as e:\n        output_message = f\"Error executing action '{ADD_COMMENT_TO_DETECTION_SCRIPT_NAME}'. Reason: {e}\"\n        status = EXECUTION_STATE_FAILED\n        siemplify.LOGGER.error(output_message)\n        siemplify.LOGGER.exception(e)\n        result_value = False\n\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\"----------------- Main - Finished -----------------\")\n    siemplify.LOGGER.info(\n        f\"\\n  status: {status}\\n  is_success: {result_value}\\n  output_message: {output_message}\"\n    )\n    siemplify.end(output_message, result_value, status)\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","IntegrationIdentifier":"CrowdStrikeFalcon","ScriptResultName":"is_success","DynamicResultsMetadata":null,"Creator":"Admin","IsEnabled":true,"IsCustom":true,"AiGenerated":false,"IsSystem":false,"Version":1.0,"TimeoutSeconds":600,"IsAsync":null,"AsyncPollingIntervalInSeconds":300,"TotalIntervalTimeoutForAsyncInSeconds":3600,"Parameters":[{"CustomActionId":0,"IsMandatory":true,"DefaultValue":"","Description":"Specify the id of the detection to which you want to add a comment.","Name":"Detection ID","Value":"","Type":0,"OptionalValues":null,"OptionalValuesJson":null},{"CustomActionId":0,"IsMandatory":true,"DefaultValue":"","Description":"Specify the comment that needs to be added to the detection.","Name":"Comment","Value":"","Type":0,"OptionalValues":null,"OptionalValuesJson":null}],"DefaultResultValue":"","PythonVersion":"None","ActionType":1,"SimulationData":{"Entities":[]},"SimulationDataJson":"{\"Entities\": []}","AICategories":[],"AIDescription":"### General Description\nThe **Add Comment to Detection** action allows users to append a comment to one or more detections in the CrowdStrike Falcon platform. This action is primarily used to document investigation findings, provide context for other analysts, or update the audit trail of a detection directly within the CrowdStrike console. It also supports updating the status of the detection simultaneously.\n\n### Parameters Description\n| Parameter | Type | Mandatory | Description |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Detection IDs** | String | Yes | A comma-separated list of unique CrowdStrike Detection IDs to which the comment will be added. |\n| **Comment** | String | Yes | The text content of the comment to be appended to the detection(s). |\n| **Status** | String | No | The new status to assign to the detections. Common values include 'new', 'in_progress', 'true_positive', 'false_positive', 'ignored', or 'closed'. |\n\n### Additional Notes\n- This action performs a state change in the external CrowdStrike Falcon system by adding metadata (comments) and potentially modifying the detection status.\n- If multiple IDs are provided, the same comment and status update will be applied to all of them.\n\n### Flow Description\n1. **Initialization:** The action initializes the CrowdStrike Manager using the provided API credentials.\n2. **Input Processing:** It parses the comma-separated string of Detection IDs into a list and retrieves the comment and status parameters.\n3. **API Interaction:** The action sends a `PATCH` request to the CrowdStrike Detections API endpoint (`/detects/entities/detects/v2`).\n4. **Payload Delivery:** The payload contains the list of IDs, the comment string, and the status value.\n5. **Verification:** The action validates the API response to ensure the comment was successfully added and the status was updated if specified.","EntityTypes":[]}